===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of or referring to the [[Middle Stone Age]] (also the '''Mesolithic''' period or the '''Mesolithic''' age), a [[prehistoric]] period that lasted between 10,000 and 3,000 [[BC]].

